WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.549 --> 00:00:09.819
&gt;&gt; IT'S HARD TO THINK OF A

00:00:08.117 --> 00:00:10.953
TOUGHER OR MORE IMPORTANT JOB

00:00:09.952 --> 00:00:11.354
THAN BEING A AIR TRAFFIC

00:00:11.087 --> 00:00:12.855
CONTROLLER.

00:00:11.487 --> 00:00:13.656
GO AHEAD AND TRY, IT WILL TAKE

00:00:12.989 --> 00:00:15.725
YOU A WHILE.

00:00:13.789 --> 00:00:17.627
EVERY DAY MORE THAN 2.5 MILLION

00:00:15.858 --> 00:00:18.928
AMERICANS FLY IN OR OUT OF U.S.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:21.497
AIRPORTS, ALONG WITH MANY

00:00:19.061 --> 00:00:24.600
BILLIONS OF DOLLARS OF CARGO.

00:00:21.631 --> 00:00:25.267
AT ANY ONE TIME THERE ARE 5,000

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:25.601
AIRCRAFT ABOVE THE UNITED

00:00:25.401 --> 00:00:28.337
STATES.

00:00:25.735 --> 00:00:29.605
ON 9/11, AIR TRAFFIC CONTROLLERS

00:00:28.471 --> 00:00:31.507
GUIDED EVERY ONE OF THEM TO A

00:00:29.739 --> 00:00:31.807
SAFE LANDING IN A LITTLE OVER AN

00:00:31.641 --> 00:00:32.742
HOUR.

00:00:31.941 --> 00:00:34.577
GO AHEAD AND TRY THAT.

00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:35.478
IT'S A JOB WHERE A SMALL MISTAKE

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:36.879
COULD LEAD INSTANTLY TO THE

00:00:35.611 --> 00:00:38.881
DEATHS OF HUNDREDS OF PEOPLE.

00:00:37.013 --> 00:00:40.016
NOT SURPRISINGLY, THE HIRING

00:00:39.015 --> 00:00:41.417
STANDARDS FOR AIR TRAFFIC

00:00:40.149 --> 00:00:44.153
CONTROLLERS WERE LONG AMONG THE

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:44.453
MOST SELECTIVE OF ALL FEDERAL

00:00:44.286 --> 00:00:46.222
JOBS.

00:00:44.587 --> 00:00:47.123
APPLICANTS TYPICALLY NEEDED TO

00:00:46.355 --> 00:00:50.059
COMPLETE MILITARY SERVICE OR

00:00:47.256 --> 00:00:51.060
PASS THE FAA'S COLLEGIATE

00:00:50.192 --> 00:00:53.963
TRAINING INITIATIVE PROGRAM.

00:00:51.193 --> 00:00:55.898
AFTER THAT THEY SAT FOR A

00:00:54.096 --> 00:00:57.767
SPECIALLY-DESIGNED EXAM THAT

00:00:56.032 --> 00:00:58.901
TESTED FOR MATH ABILITY AND

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.769
COMPLEX PROBLEM-SOLVING.

00:00:59.035 --> 00:01:00.936
ONLY THOSE WITH THE HIGHEST

00:00:59.902 --> 00:01:02.338
SCORES MADE THE CUT.

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:03.272
THE SYSTEM WAS DESIGNED TO

00:01:02.471 --> 00:01:05.041
CHOOSE THE BEST.

00:01:03.406 --> 00:01:08.144
FOR DECADES IT WORKED.

00:01:05.174 --> 00:01:08.778
THEN DURING THE OBAMA

00:01:08.277 --> 00:01:09.578
ADMINISTRATION, ACTIVIST

00:01:08.911 --> 00:01:11.614
BUREAUCRATS DECIDED THAT THE

00:01:09.712 --> 00:01:12.815
POOL OF AIR TRAFFIC CONTROLLERS

00:01:11.747 --> 00:01:14.617
WASN'T DIVERSE ENOUGH.

00:01:12.948 --> 00:01:17.420
THEY NEVER EXPLAINED WHY

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:19.622
DIVERSITY OUGHT TO MATTER IN AIR

00:01:17.553 --> 00:01:21.257
TRAFFIC CONTROL, OR WHY IT WAS

00:01:19.755 --> 00:01:22.391
MORE THAN TRADITIONAL GOALS LIKE

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:24.260
COMPETENCE AND PUBLIC SAFETY.

00:01:22.525 --> 00:01:26.696
THE FAA WITHOUT A VOTE, JUST

00:01:24.393 --> 00:01:29.198
SCRAPPED THE OLD HIRING SYSTEM

00:01:26.829 --> 00:01:29.932
AND REPLACED IT WITH A DIVERSITY

00:01:29.331 --> 00:01:33.369
FRIENDLY VERSION.

00:01:30.066 --> 00:01:33.803
MOST PEOPLE HAVE NO IDEA THIS

00:01:33.502 --> 00:01:34.937
HAPPENED.

00:01:33.936 --> 00:01:37.673
THE FAA REQUIRES APPLICANTS TO

00:01:35.071 --> 00:01:39.975
FILL OUT A BIOGRAPHICAL

00:01:37.807 --> 00:01:40.409
QUESTIONNAIRE BEFORE ANOTHER

00:01:40.109 --> 00:01:41.811
SCREENING.

00:01:40.543 --> 00:01:49.719
THOSE THAT ANSWER THE QUESTIONS

00:01:41.944 --> 00:01:52.088
IN A WAY THAT DIVERSITY MONITORS

00:01:49.885 --> 00:01:56.492
DON'T LIKE WILL NOT GO FURTHER,

00:01:52.221 --> 00:01:57.626
BECAUSE THE BIOGRAPHICAL

00:01:56.692 --> 00:01:59.595
QUESTIONNAIRE IS ALL IMPORTANT.

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:00.463
WE GOT A COPY OF THE

00:01:59.729 --> 00:02:01.464
QUESTIONNAIRE, HOW IT'S SCORED.

00:02:00.596 --> 00:02:04.800
IT'S SHOCKING.

00:02:01.597 --> 00:02:05.868
FOR EXAMPLE, ONE QUESTION ASKED

00:02:04.934 --> 00:02:07.203
TEST-TAKERS TO NAME THEIR WORST

00:02:07.336 --> 00:02:09.071
THE PROTESTER ANSWER FOR THAT IS

00:02:08.871 --> 00:02:10.506
SCIENCE.

00:02:09.205 --> 00:02:12.074
IN OTHER WORDS, IF YOU CAN'T DO

00:02:10.906 --> 00:02:14.477
SCIENCE, THE FAA IS SPECIALLY

00:02:12.208 --> 00:02:15.377
EAGER TO HIRE YOU AS AN AIR

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:17.213
TRAFFIC CONTROLLER.

00:02:15.511 --> 00:02:18.647
YOU GET 10 POINTS FOR BEING BAD

00:02:17.346 --> 00:02:19.448
AT SCIENCE, ACCORDING TO THE

00:02:18.781 --> 00:02:20.349
SCORING SHEET.

00:02:19.582 --> 00:02:21.250
ANOTHER QUESTION ASKED ABOUT

00:02:20.483 --> 00:02:22.885
WORK HISTORY.

00:02:21.383 --> 00:02:24.787
ACCORDING TO THE FAA, THE BEST

00:02:23.018 --> 00:02:25.688
ANSWER TO THAT QUESTION IS YOU

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:27.423
HAVEN'T WORKED AT ALL IN THE

00:02:25.821 --> 00:02:30.426
PAST THREE YEARS.

00:02:27.556 --> 00:02:30.760
YOU GET 10 POINTS FOR NOT

00:02:30.559 --> 00:02:32.862
WORKING.

00:02:30.893 --> 00:02:34.396
APPARENTLY UNEMPLOYED PEOPLE

00:02:32.995 --> 00:02:34.797
MAKE THE BEST AIR TRAFFIC

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:35.865
CONTROLLERS.

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:37.166
THIS IS DEMENTED, BY THE WAY,

00:02:35.998 --> 00:02:38.167
BUT IT'S REAL.

00:02:37.299 --> 00:02:39.502
SO DO APPLICANTS WHO PLAYED A

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:41.103
LOT OF SPORTS IN HIGH SCHOOL.

00:02:39.635 --> 00:02:43.305
THEY'RE REWARDED TOO.

00:02:41.237 --> 00:02:45.608
BY CONTRAST APPLICANTS WHO SAY

00:02:43.439 --> 00:02:46.876
THEY KNOW A GREAT DEAL ABOUT AIR

00:02:45.741 --> 00:02:47.443
TRAFFIC CONTROL GET ONLY FIVE

00:02:47.009 --> 00:02:48.878
POINTS.

00:02:47.576 --> 00:02:50.146
TRAINED PILOTS GET TWO POINTS.

00:02:49.011 --> 00:02:51.447
ONCE AGAIN, APPLICANTS WHO

00:02:50.279 --> 00:02:53.282
HAVEN'T WORKED AT ALL, WHO HAVE

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:56.318
BEEN UNEMPLOYED FOR THE PAST

00:02:53.415 --> 00:02:57.520
THREE YEARS, GET 10 POINTS.

00:02:56.452 --> 00:02:59.321
PILOTS TWO POINTS.

00:02:57.653 --> 00:02:59.822
THIS IS INSANE.

00:02:59.455 --> 00:03:01.257
IT'S DANGEROUS.

00:02:59.955 --> 00:03:03.225
IT'S ALSO INDEFENSIBLE.

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:06.095
WE ASKED THE FAA'S TOP SPOKESMAN

00:03:03.359 --> 00:03:07.897
WHY APPLICANTS FOR AN AIR

00:03:06.228 --> 00:03:10.132
TRAFFIC CONTROL JOB WOULD GET

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:11.300
MORE POINTS FOR HIGH SCHOOL

00:03:10.266 --> 00:03:12.701
SPORTS THAN FLYING PLANES OR

00:03:11.433 --> 00:03:13.035
KNOWING A LOT ABOUT AIR TRAFFIC

00:03:12.835 --> 00:03:14.637
CONTROL.

00:03:13.169 --> 00:03:17.106
HIS RESPONSE, QUOTE, I'M TRYING

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:18.207
TO FIND THAT OUT AS WELL.

00:03:17.239 --> 00:03:19.341
WELL, NOT TRYING VERY HARD IT

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:21.177
TURNS OUT.

00:03:19.475 --> 00:03:22.611
WE STILL HAVEN'T HEARD BACK WITH

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:23.712
A REAL EXPLANATION, AND OF

00:03:22.745 --> 00:03:26.081
COURSE WE WON'T BECAUSE THERE

00:03:23.846 --> 00:03:26.448
ISN'T ONE, OTHER THAN SHUT UP,

00:03:26.215 --> 00:03:27.149
DIVERSITY.

00:03:26.582 --> 00:03:28.184
WE WON'T SHUT UP.

00:03:27.283 --> 00:03:29.618
THIS IS TOO PAR.

00:03:28.317 --> 00:03:31.020
LIVES ARE AT STAKE.

00:03:29.752 --> 00:03:32.955
JOINING IS MICHAEL PEARSON, A

00:03:31.153 --> 00:03:36.659
LAWYER REPRESENTING A MAN SUING

00:03:33.088 --> 00:03:37.560
THE FAA FOR ITS UPDATED HIRING

00:03:36.792 --> 00:03:38.194
PRACTICES.

00:03:37.693 --> 00:03:38.727
MR. PEARSON, THANK YOU FOR

00:03:38.327 --> 00:03:39.662
COMING ON.

00:03:38.861 --> 00:03:40.563
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU, TUCKER.

00:03:39.795 --> 00:03:43.399
GOOD TO BE HERE.

00:03:40.996 --> 00:03:45.434
&gt;&gt; WHY WOULD THE FAA AWARD EXTRA

00:03:43.532 --> 00:03:46.001
POINTS FOR INCOMPETENCE?

00:03:45.568 --> 00:03:52.675
SCIENCE, FOR EXAMPLE?

00:03:46.135 --> 00:03:53.876
&gt;&gt; WELL, THE BIOGRAPHICAL

00:03:52.808 --> 00:03:55.110
ASSESSMENT WAS MADE TO SCREEN

00:03:54.009 --> 00:03:56.912
OUT PEOPLE WITH EXPERIENCE.

00:03:55.244 --> 00:03:58.781
IT WASN'T MEANT IN ANY FORM OR

00:03:57.046 --> 00:04:00.616
FUNCTION, THAT I CAN FIND -- AND

00:03:58.914 --> 00:04:02.618
I'VE BEEN LOOKING AT THIS FOR

00:04:00.749 --> 00:04:03.519
ALMOST FOUR YEARS NOW, INCLUDING

00:04:02.751 --> 00:04:05.754
LOOKING OVER MANY DOCUMENTS WE

00:04:03.652 --> 00:04:08.757
HAD TO FIGHT THE FAA FOR SEVERAL

00:04:05.888 --> 00:04:10.326
YEARS THAT THEY KEPT HIDDEN --

00:04:08.891 --> 00:04:11.460
TO ANSWER THAT QUESTION.

00:04:10.459 --> 00:04:13.863
THE TEST WAS BASICALLY MEANT TO

00:04:11.594 --> 00:04:14.296
SCREEN OUT PEOPLE WITH AVIATION

00:04:13.996 --> 00:04:15.331
EXPERIENCE.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:18.801
THERE'S EVEN WORSE QUESTIONS AND

00:04:15.464 --> 00:04:21.837
ANSWERS ON THE TEST, BUT YOU DID

00:04:18.934 --> 00:04:23.839
A PRETTY GOOD JOB OF PORTRAYING

00:04:21.971 --> 00:04:24.607
SOME OF THE QUESTIONS AND

00:04:23.973 --> 00:04:25.407
ANSWERS ON THE TEST.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:27.142
&gt;&gt; I DON'T UNDERSTAND.

00:04:25.574 --> 00:04:28.844
JUST TO RESTATE FOR OUR

00:04:27.276 --> 00:04:30.880
AUDIENCE, SO NUMB TO THIS KIND

00:04:28.978 --> 00:04:31.247
OF THINKING THAT IT MAY NOT

00:04:31.013 --> 00:04:33.949
PENETRATE.

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:34.817
WE'RE NOT TALKING ABOUT HIRING A

00:04:34.083 --> 00:04:37.219
SOCIOLOGY PROFESSOR.

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:39.822
WE'RE TALKING ABOUT AIR TRAFFIC

00:04:37.353 --> 00:04:40.856
CONTROLLERS, WITH A LINCHPIN OF

00:04:39.955 --> 00:04:41.323
PUBLIC SAFETY AND

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:44.293
TRANSPORTATION.

00:04:41.457 --> 00:04:46.595
WHY WOULD THE FAA WANT PEOPLE

00:04:44.426 --> 00:04:48.497
WITH LESS RELEVANT SKILLS IN AIR

00:04:46.729 --> 00:04:48.898
TRAFFIC CONTROL FOR AIR TRAFFIC

00:04:48.631 --> 00:04:50.933
CONTROLLERS?

00:04:49.198 --> 00:04:52.835
&gt;&gt; BECAUSE A GROUP WITHIN THE

00:04:51.066 --> 00:04:53.802
FAA, INCLUDING THE HUMAN

00:04:52.968 --> 00:04:55.638
RESOURCES FUNCTION WITHIN THE

00:04:53.936 --> 00:04:57.539
FAA, INCLUDING THE NATIONAL

00:04:55.771 --> 00:04:58.374
BLACK COALITION OF FEDERAL

00:04:57.673 --> 00:05:00.676
AVIATION EMPLOYEES, DETERMINED

00:04:58.507 --> 00:05:01.277
THAT THE WORKFORCE WAS TOO

00:05:00.809 --> 00:05:03.379
WHITE.

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:04.613
THEY HAD A CONCERTED EFFORT

00:05:03.512 --> 00:05:05.247
THROUGH THE DEPARTMENT OF

00:05:04.747 --> 00:05:06.582
TRANSPORTATION, THE OBAMA

00:05:05.381 --> 00:05:08.217
ADMINISTRATION, TO CHANGE THAT.

00:05:06.715 --> 00:05:11.420
AND QUITE FRANKLY, THEY'RE

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:12.988
SACRIFICING, AND HAVE SACRIFICED

00:05:11.553 --> 00:05:15.024
SAFETY AT THE 589ER OF POLITICAL

00:05:14.123 --> 00:05:19.495
CORRECTNESS.

00:05:15.157 --> 00:05:20.696
IT OFFENDS THE PUBLIC CONSCIOUS,

00:05:19.628 --> 00:05:21.330
BUT ALSO FEDERAL LAW.

00:05:20.896 --> 00:05:23.532
WE'RE EXPOSING THAT.

00:05:21.463 --> 00:05:27.036
&gt;&gt; WHY WOULD THIS GO ON FOR

00:05:23.666 --> 00:05:28.170
YEARS WITHOUT ANYBODY IN ELECTED

00:05:27.169 --> 00:05:29.772
OFFICE SAYING ANYTHING ABOUT IT?

00:05:28.304 --> 00:05:31.340
JUST ONCE AGAIN -- I'M HARD TO

00:05:29.905 --> 00:05:33.776
SHOCK, BECAUSE I DO THIS STUFF

00:05:31.473 --> 00:05:38.047
FOR A LIVING -- WE ARE LOWERING

00:05:34.109 --> 00:05:38.814
THE STANDARDS, AND INTENTIONALLY

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:41.317
HIRING PEOPLE LESS COMPETENT FOR

00:05:38.948 --> 00:05:42.451
ONE OF THE MOST CRITICAL JOBS IN

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:44.086
THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT?

00:05:42.584 --> 00:05:47.690
WHY WOULD NO ONE IN CONGRESS DO

00:05:44.219 --> 00:05:49.391
ANYTHING TO STOP IT?

00:05:47.823 --> 00:05:50.859
&gt;&gt; WELL, OUR LAW FIRM, ALONG

00:05:49.525 --> 00:05:51.860
WITH MOUNTAIN STATE'S LEGAL

00:05:51.093 --> 00:05:52.194
FOUNDATION, FILED THE INITIAL

00:05:51.994 --> 00:05:54.396
LAWSUIT.

00:05:52.328 --> 00:05:57.533
THEN THE GROUP OF SCHOOLS GOT

00:05:54.897 --> 00:05:58.233
TOGETHER, OVER 30 COLLEGIATE

00:05:57.666 --> 00:05:59.401
TRAINING INSTITUTIONAL SCHOOLS

00:05:58.367 --> 00:05:59.768
GOT TOGETHER AND WENT TO

00:05:59.535 --> 00:06:04.840
CONGRESS.

00:05:59.902 --> 00:06:06.075
THERE HAVE BEEN MEMBERS OF

00:06:04.974 --> 00:06:06.742
CONGRESS THAT HAVE HELD HEARINGS

00:06:06.208 --> 00:06:11.246
ON THIS.

00:06:06.875 --> 00:06:16.518
THE PROBLEM IS THAT THE UNION

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:18.354
CONTROLS A LARGE PACT THAT FUNDS

00:06:16.652 --> 00:06:19.421
POLITICIANS, AND NOTHING WILL

00:06:18.487 --> 00:06:21.090
GET PAST WITHOUT THE BLESSING OF

00:06:19.555 --> 00:06:22.491
THE CONTROLLERS UNION.

00:06:21.223 --> 00:06:23.726
THEIR POSITION RADICALLY CHANGED

00:06:22.624 --> 00:06:25.394
WHEN THE OBAMA ADMINISTRATION

00:06:23.859 --> 00:06:27.563
CAME IN.

00:06:25.527 --> 00:06:28.597
I'M NOT SAYING THAT LIGHTLY.

00:06:27.696 --> 00:06:29.431
I WAS AN AIR TRAFFIC CONTROLLER

00:06:28.731 --> 00:06:30.599
AT FOUR OF THE BUSIEST

00:06:29.565 --> 00:06:32.301
FACILITIES IN THE COUNTRY FOR

00:06:30.733 --> 00:06:34.103
ALMOST 27 YEARS, ALONG WITH

00:06:32.434 --> 00:06:36.338
BEING AN ATTORNEY AND PROFESSOR.

00:06:34.236 --> 00:06:37.706
WHEN I SAY THESE THINGS, IT'S

00:06:36.472 --> 00:06:38.574
NOT ONLY BASED ON EXPERIENCE,

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:40.676
BUT DOCUMENTARY EVIDENCE AND

00:06:38.707 --> 00:06:42.211
PROOF I HAVE.

00:06:40.809 --> 00:06:43.412
AT THE END OF THE DAY EVERYONE

00:06:42.344 --> 00:06:44.546
FLIES, INCLUDING MEMBERS OF

00:06:43.545 --> 00:06:47.049
CONGRESS, WHO FLY QUITE OFTEN.

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:49.385
I THINK THE ONES THAT HEARD THE

00:06:47.182 --> 00:06:51.353
STORY WERE OFFENDED BY IT,

00:06:49.518 --> 00:06:53.155
BECAUSE IT'S IN THEIR BACKYARD.

00:06:51.487 --> 00:06:54.790
IT'S A SAFETY INTEREST FOR THEM.

00:06:53.288 --> 00:06:56.692
THIS IS NOT A PARTISAN ISSUE,

00:06:54.923 --> 00:06:59.128
QUITE FRANKLY, BECAUSE, AGAIN,

00:06:56.825 --> 00:06:59.728
IT'S THE SAFETY OF THE NATIONAL

00:06:59.261 --> 00:07:01.397
AIRSPACE AT RISK HERE.

00:06:59.862 --> 00:07:03.098
I CAN TELL YOU FROM TRAINING

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:04.633
WELL OVER A HUNDRED, PROBABLY

00:07:03.232 --> 00:07:06.635
300 CONTROLLERS IN MY LIFETIME

00:07:04.767 --> 00:07:07.803
AS AN FAA CONTROLLER, THAT THERE

00:07:06.769 --> 00:07:10.305
IS A DIFFERENCE.

00:07:07.936 --> 00:07:11.306
THIS IS AIKEN TO THE VETERANS

00:07:10.506 --> 00:07:12.808
ADMINISTRATION HIRING DOCTORS

00:07:11.707 --> 00:07:14.343
AND TRYING TO TELL THE PUBLIC

00:07:12.941 --> 00:07:16.111
THAT THE BEST PHYSICIAN IS ONE

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:17.946
THAT NEVER WENT TO MEDICAL

00:07:16.245 --> 00:07:19.448
SCHOOL AND THAT THE VA CAN TRAIN

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.649
THEM BETTER.

00:07:19.581 --> 00:07:21.016
THAT'S EXACTLY WHAT'S OCCURRED

00:07:20.783 --> 00:07:23.786
HERE.

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:25.921
TO BE VERY STRAIGHTFORWARD, THE

00:07:23.919 --> 00:07:27.389
MAINSTREAM MEDIA HAS NOT COVERED

00:07:26.055 --> 00:07:29.825
THIS, AND HAS COVERED UP THIS

00:07:27.523 --> 00:07:30.492
ISSUE, AND HAS NOT REVEALED

00:07:29.958 --> 00:07:31.927
WHAT'S GOING ON.

00:07:30.659 --> 00:07:35.230
IT'S A SHAME.

00:07:32.061 --> 00:07:36.999
IT'S NOT ONLY SHAMEFUL, IT AGAIN

00:07:35.364 --> 00:07:38.634
SACRIFICES PUBLIC SAFETY.

00:07:37.132 --> 00:07:40.402
&gt;&gt; IT GOES WITHOUT SAYING,

00:07:38.767 --> 00:07:43.839
PEOPLE IN THE FAA WE SPOKE TO,

00:07:40.602 --> 00:07:47.843
WERE SUCH COWARDLY WORMS, I

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:49.411
DON'T SAY THAT LIGHTLY, BUT THEY

00:07:47.976 --> 00:07:51.080
WON'T COME ON AND DEFEND THIS.

00:07:49.778 --> 00:07:51.814
A RHETORICAL QUESTION, DID THE

00:07:51.213 --> 00:07:53.682
OBAMA ADMINISTRATION EVER SHOW

00:07:51.947 --> 00:07:56.919
WITH DATA THAT SOMEHOW INCREASED

00:07:53.816 --> 00:07:58.420
DIVERSITY?

00:07:57.086 --> 00:07:59.788
THE RANKS OF AIR TRAFFIC

00:07:58.554 --> 00:08:00.522
CONTROLLERS WOULD MAKE THE

00:08:00.222 --> 00:08:02.057
PUBLIC SAFER?

00:08:00.656 --> 00:08:03.659
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY NOT.

00:08:02.191 --> 00:08:04.860
THERE'S DATA THAT SHOWS IT'S A

00:08:04.059 --> 00:08:06.929
PUBLIC FARCE, INCORRECT.

00:08:04.993 --> 00:08:08.163
THERE'S NO DATA TO SUPPORT THAT.

00:08:07.062 --> 00:08:10.866
THIS IS SOCIAL ENGINEERING AT

00:08:08.297 --> 00:08:11.700
ITS FINEST AT THE SACRIFICE

00:08:10.999 --> 00:08:13.535
AGAIN OF PUBLIC SAFETY.

